                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Lost Grimoires: Stolen Kingdom is a fairly standard game of its genre, and very on par with other Artifex Mundi games. It's quite casual, and the story is decent. The achievements were simple and easy to get in one playthrough, which I particularly like with games such as this.\n\nI recommend picking it up in a bundle or on sale, as I was able to complete my playthrough in just over 2 hours. Other than that, if you enjoy hidden object games, you'll likely enjoy this one!",
